sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Router
    participant Manager as Manager Agent
    participant Plan as Plan Agent
    participant TP as ThreadPoolExecutor
    box Aqua Parallel Tool Agent Threads
    participant T1 as Tool Agent 1
    participant T2 as Tool Agent 2
    participant T3 as Tool Agent 3
    end
    participant MCP as OXII MCP Server
    participant LLM as Gemini 2.5 Pro

    Note over User,LLM: Case: Plan Execution with PARALLEL Multi-Threading<br/>Improvement: 3-5x faster than sequential!

    %% User selects plan
    User->>Router: POST /ai/chat/text<br/>"Execute Plan 1"
    activate Router
    Router->>Manager: {input, token, sessionId}
    activate Manager
    
    rect rgb(200, 220, 240)
        Note over Manager,LLM: 🔍 ANALYZE & ROUTE
        Manager->>LLM: Analyze query
        activate LLM
        LLM-->>Manager: agent_type: plan
        deactivate LLM
        Manager->>Plan: {selected_plan_id: 1}
        activate Plan
    end

    rect rgb(220, 240, 200)
        Note over Plan: 📋 PLAN SELECTED:<br/>Security Priority Plan<br/>Tasks: 3
        Plan->>Plan: Load plan_options
        Plan->>Plan: Select security_plan
        
        Note over Plan: Tasks:<br/>1. Lock all doors<br/>2. Close windows<br/>3. Activate alarm
    end

    rect rgb(240, 220, 240)
        Note over Plan,TP: 🚀 INITIALIZE PARALLEL EXECUTION
        Plan->>TP: Create ThreadPoolExecutor<br/>max_workers=3
        activate TP
        Note over TP: Thread pool ready<br/>with 3 workers
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 220)
        Note over Plan,TP: 📤 SUBMIT ALL TASKS SIMULTANEOUSLY
        Plan->>TP: Submit Task 1 (Lock doors)
        Plan->>TP: Submit Task 2 (Close windows)
        Plan->>TP: Submit Task 3 (Activate alarm)
        Note over TP: All tasks queued<br/>⏱️ Time: 0.001s
    end

    rect rgb(220, 255, 220)
        Note over TP,MCP: 🔥 PARALLEL EXECUTION STARTS
        
        par Task 1: Lock all doors
            TP->>T1: Execute in Thread-0
            activate T1
            T1->>T1: Create event loop
            T1->>MCP: Connect SSE
            activate MCP
            MCP-->>T1: Load tools
            T1->>LLM: Reason & plan
            activate LLM
            LLM-->>T1: tool_calls
            deactivate LLM
            T1->>MCP: lock_controls(door_ids)
            MCP-->>T1: ✅ "All doors locked"
            deactivate MCP
            T1->>T1: Cleanup event loop
            T1-->>TP: Success
            deactivate T1
            
        and Task 2: Close windows
            TP->>T2: Execute in Thread-1
            activate T2
            T2->>T2: Create event loop
            T2->>MCP: Connect SSE
            activate MCP
            MCP-->>T2: Load tools
            T2->>LLM: Reason & plan
            activate LLM
            LLM-->>T2: tool_calls
            deactivate LLM
            T2->>MCP: close_windows(window_ids)
            MCP-->>T2: ✅ "Windows closed"
            deactivate MCP
            T2->>T2: Cleanup event loop
            T2-->>TP: Success
            deactivate T2
            
        and Task 3: Activate alarm
            TP->>T3: Execute in Thread-2
            activate T3
            T3->>T3: Create event loop
            T3->>MCP: Connect SSE
            activate MCP
            MCP-->>T3: Load tools
            T3->>LLM: Reason & plan
            activate LLM
            LLM-->>T3: tool_calls
            deactivate LLM
            T3->>MCP: activate_alarm()
            MCP-->>T3: ✅ "Alarm activated"
            deactivate MCP
            T3->>T3: Cleanup event loop
            T3-->>TP: Success
            deactivate T3
        end
        
        Note over T1,T3: ⚡ All tasks running SIMULTANEOUSLY<br/>⏱️ Total time: max(task_times) ≈ 10s
    end

    rect rgb(240, 240, 255)
        Note over TP,Plan: 🔒 THREAD-SAFE RESULT COLLECTION
        TP->>Plan: with results_lock:<br/>  completed_tasks.append()
        TP->>Plan: execution_results.append()
        Note over Plan: All 3 tasks completed<br/>Success rate: 100%
        
        Plan->>TP: Shutdown thread pool
        deactivate TP
        Note over TP: ✨ Clean shutdown
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 220)
        Note over Plan: 📊 GENERATE SUMMARY
        Plan->>Plan: Calculate metrics:<br/>• Total: 3<br/>• Completed: 3<br/>• Failed: 0<br/>• Success: 100%
        
        Plan-->>Manager: {<br/>  output: "Security Plan Complete",<br/>  execution_results: [...]<br/>}
        deactivate Plan
    end

    Manager-->>Router: Success response
    deactivate Manager
    Router-->>User: HTTP 200<br/>"✅ Security Plan Executed"
    deactivate Router

    %% Timing comparison
    Note over User,LLM: ⏱️ PERFORMANCE COMPARISON:<br/><br/>Sequential Execution:<br/>• Task 1: 10s<br/>• Task 2: 10s<br/>• Task 3: 10s<br/>• Total: 30s<br/><br/>Parallel Execution:<br/>• Task 1, 2, 3: ~10s (concurrent)<br/>• Total: ~10s<br/><br/>🚀 SPEEDUP: 3x faster!<br/>💡 More tasks = more speedup

    Note over User,LLM: 🎯 KEY FEATURES:<br/>• Dynamic thread pool (workers = num_tasks)<br/>• Isolated event loops per thread<br/>• Thread-safe result collection (Lock)<br/>• Comprehensive timeout handling<br/>• Graceful error isolation<br/>• Real-time logging per thread
